    {
      "id": "5f199f997089-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If a 2 + b 2 + c 2 = ab + bc + ac, then find the value of a 3 + b 3 + c 3 .",
      "questionHtml": "If a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>+ c<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= ab + bc + ac, then find the value of a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ c<sup>3</sup>.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3abc",
          "html": "3abc"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "None of the above",
          "html": "None of the above"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png' width='26px' /> <u style='font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; display: inline !important;'>Shortcut Trick</u></span>\n<p>For real numbers, the condition a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ac is satisfied only when a = b = c.</p>\n<p>Let a = b = c = 1. Then, 1<sup>2</sup> + 1<sup>2</sup> + 1<sup>2</sup> = 1×1 + 1×1 + 1×1 ⇒ 3 = 3.</p>\n<p>Substitute these values into the required expression: a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 1<sup>3</sup> + 1<sup>3</sup> + 1<sup>3</sup> = 3.</p>\n<p>Among the options, 3abc = 3 × 1 × 1 × 1 = 3, which matches the result.</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 3abc.</strong></p>\n<p><span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png' width='26px' /><strong><span style='vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;'><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>Given: a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ac</p>\n<p>Formula Used: a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> − 3abc = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> − ab − bc − ac)</p>\n<p>⇒ a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> − ab − bc − ac = 0</p>\n<p>⇒ a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> − 3abc = (a + b + c) × (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> − ab − bc − ac)</p>\n<p>⇒ a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> − 3abc = (a + b + c) × 0</p>\n<p>⇒ a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> − 3abc = 0</p>\n<p>⇒ a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 3abc.</strong></p>\n<p><span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png' width='26px' /><strong><span style='vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;'><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Cubic Algebra Identity</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>The general expansion is a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> − 3abc = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> − ab − bc − ac).</p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Special Conditional Case</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>If a + b + c = 0, then the entire product on the right side becomes zero, resulting in a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc.</p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Equality Condition for Squares</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>The expression a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> − ab − bc − ac can be rewritten as 1/2[(a − b)<sup>2</sup> + (b − c)<sup>2</sup> + (c − a)<sup>2</sup>]. For real numbers, this is 0 only when a = b = c.</p>",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5f199f997089-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "value of \\(\\frac{{{{(a - b)}^3} + {{(b - c)}^3} + (c - a)^3}}{{{{({a^2} - {b^2})}^3} + {{({b^2} - {c^2})}^3} + {{({c^2} - {a^2})}^3}}}\\) Is equal to :",
      "questionHtml": "<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font class=\"goog-text-highlight\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">value of&nbsp;</font></font></font></font><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{{{(a - b)}^3} + {{(b - c)}^3} + (c - a)^3}}{{{{({a^2} - {b^2})}^3} + {{({b^2} - {c^2})}^3} + {{({c^2} - {a^2})}^3}}}\\)</span><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font class=\"goog-text-highlight\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;Is equal to :</font></font></font>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "ab + bc + ca",
          "html": "ab + bc + ca"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{{(a + b)(b + c)(c + a)}}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{{(a + b)(b + c)(c + a)}}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Concept used:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">If x + y + z = 0, then, x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = 3xyz</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Calculations:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{{{(a - b)}^3} + {{(b - c)}^3} + (c - a)^3}}{{{{({a^2} - {b^2})}^3} + {{({b^2} - {c^2})}^3} + {{({c^2} - {a^2})}^3}}}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">x = (a - b)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">y = (b - c)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">z = (c - a)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">x + y + z = a - b + b - c + c - a = (a + b + c) - (a + b + c) = 0</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">So, <span style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41);\">x</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41);\"> + y</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41);\"> + z</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color:  (33, 37, 41);\"> = 3xyz = 3(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Similarly,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">m = (a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">n = (b<sup>2</sup> - c<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">o = (c<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">m + n + o = (a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>) + (b<sup>2</sup> - c<sup>2</sup>) + (c<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup>) = 0</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">So, m<sup>3</sup> + n<sup>3</sup> + o<sup>3</sup> = 3mno = 3<span style=\"\">(a&sup2;-b&sup2;)(b&sup2;-c&sup2;)(c&sup2;-a&sup2;)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Thus, we have :</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3(a-b)(b-c)(c-a)}{3(a²-b²)(b²-c²)(c²-a²)}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">=<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3(a-b)(b-c)(c-a)}{3(a-b)(a+b)(b-c)(b+c)(c-a)(c+a)}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">= <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{(a+b)(b+c)(c+a)}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\therefore\\)</span> The correct answer is option (4).</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5f199f997089-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If a + b + c = 1, ab + bc + ca = -8 and a 3 + b 3 + c 3 = -11, then what is the value of \\(\\frac{{\\rm{a}}}{{{\\rm{bc}}}} + \\frac{{\\rm{b}}}{{{\\rm{ac}}}} + \\frac{{\\rm{c}}}{{{\\rm{ab}}}}\\) ?",
      "questionHtml": "If a + b + c = 1, ab + bc + ca = -8 and a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ c<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= -11, then what is the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{\\rm{a}}}{{{\\rm{bc}}}} + \\frac{{\\rm{b}}}{{{\\rm{ac}}}} + \\frac{{\\rm{c}}}{{{\\rm{ab}}}}\\)</span>?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{4}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{{ - 17}}{{12}}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{ - 17}}{{12}}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{7}{{12}}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{7}{{12}}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{{ - 5}}{4}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{ - 5}}{4}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Formula:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">a<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;- 3abc&nbsp;= (a&nbsp;+ b&nbsp;+ c) &times; (a<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;- ab&nbsp;- bc&nbsp;- ac)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">(a + b + c)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 2&nbsp;&times; (ab + bc + ac)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Calculation:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Substituting the values in&nbsp;<span style=\"\">a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ c</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- 3abc</span> , we get-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; -11 - 3abc = 1&nbsp;&times; (<span style=\"\">a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ c</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- (ab + bc + ca)</span>)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; -11 - 3abc =&nbsp;<span style=\"\">a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ c</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- (-8)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; -11 - 3abc =&nbsp;a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ c</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ 8</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; -19&nbsp;- 3abc =&nbsp;a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ c</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp; -19 -3abc = 17</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; 3abc = -36 or abc = -12</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Now, substituting the values in (a + b + c)<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; 1<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ 2&nbsp;&times; (-8)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; 1 + 16 =&nbsp;a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span>= 17</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Dividing by &quot;abc&quot; both sides, we get-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\( a^2 \\over abc\\)</span>+&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(b^2 \\over abc\\)</span>+&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(c^2\\over abc\\)</span><span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">&nbsp;</span>=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(17\\over abc\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Substituting the value of &quot;abc&quot; in the LHS, we get-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{\\rm{a}}}{{{\\rm{bc}}}} + \\frac{{\\rm{b}}}{{{\\rm{ac}}}} + \\frac{{\\rm{c}}}{{{\\rm{ab}}}}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(-17\\over 12\\)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&there4; <strong>The value of the expression is&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(-17\\over 12\\)</span>.</strong></p>\n",
