      "question": "If (5x + 3y) 3 + (5x - 3y) 3 = 10 (Cx 3 + Dxy 2 ), then find the value of 2&radic;C - D.",
      "questionHtml": "If (5x + 3y)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ (5x - 3y)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 10 (Cx<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ Dxy<sup>2</sup>), then find the value of 2&radic;C - D.",
