      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png' width='26px' /> <u style='font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; display: inline !important;'>Shortcut Trick</u></span>\n<p>Using identity: (a + b)<sup>3</sup> + (a − b)<sup>3</sup> = 2a(a<sup>2</sup> + 3b<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>Substitute a = 5x and b = 3y: 2(5x)((5x)<sup>2</sup> + 3(3y)<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>= 10x(25x<sup>2</sup> + 27y<sup>2</sup>) = 250x<sup>3</sup> + 270xy<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>Comparing with 10(Cx<sup>3</sup> + Dxy<sup>2</sup>) ⇒ C = 25, D = 27</p>\n<p>2√C − D = 2√25 − 27 = 10 − 27 = −17</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is −17.</strong></p>\n<p><span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png' width='26px' /><strong><span style='vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;'><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Given:</strong> (5x + 3y)<sup>3</sup> + (5x − 3y)<sup>3</sup> = 10(Cx<sup>3</sup> + Dxy<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong> (A + B)<sup>3</sup> + (A − B)<sup>3</sup> = 2A<sup>3</sup> + 6AB<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>⇒ Let A = 5x and B = 3y</p>\n<p>⇒ LHS = 2(5x)<sup>3</sup> + 6(5x)(3y)<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>⇒ LHS = 2(125x<sup>3</sup>) + 30x(9y<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p>⇒ LHS = 250x<sup>3</sup> + 270xy<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>⇒ 10(Cx<sup>3</sup> + Dxy<sup>2</sup>) = 250x<sup>3</sup> + 270xy<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>⇒ Cx<sup>3</sup> + Dxy<sup>2</sup> = 25x<sup>3</sup> + 27xy<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>⇒ C = 25 and D = 27</p>\n<p>⇒ Required value = 2√C − D</p>\n<p>⇒ 2√25 − 27 = 2 × 5 − 27</p>\n<p>⇒ 10 − 27 = −17</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is −17.</strong></p>\n<p><span style='display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;'><img height='26px' src='//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png' width='26px' /><strong><span style='vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;'><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Difference of Cubes Expansion</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>(a + b)<sup>3</sup> − (a − b)<sup>3</sup> = 2b<sup>3</sup> + 6a<sup>2</sup>b = 2b(b<sup>2</sup> + 3a<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Sum and Difference of Two Cubes</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> = (a + b)(a<sup>2</sup> − ab + b<sup>2</sup>) and a<sup>3</sup> − b<sup>3</sup> = (a − b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n<p style='margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;'>Standard Algebraic Identity</p>\n<p style='margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;'>(a + b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 3ab(a + b) and (a − b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> − b<sup>3</sup> − 3ab(a − b)</p>",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png",
