      "question": "Simplify- \\(\\frac{3\\times0.74\\times1.23\\times0.13}{[(0.37)^3+(0.41)^3-8(0.39)^3]}=?\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Simplify-</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3\\times0.74\\times1.23\\times0.13}{[(0.37)^3+(0.41)^3-8(0.39)^3]}=?\\)</span></p>\n",
