          "html": "-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3\\times0.74\\times1.23\\times0.13}{[(0.37)^3+(0.41)^3-8(0.39)^3]}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>If a + b + c = 0, then a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3\\times0.74\\times1.23\\times0.13}{[(0.37)^3+(0.41)^3-8(0.39)^3]}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3\\times0.74\\times1.23\\times0.13}{[(0.37)^3+(0.41)^3-2^3(0.39)^3]}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3\\times0.74\\times1.23\\times0.13}{[(0.37)^3+(0.41)^3-(0.78)^3]}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Now,</p>\n\n<p>0.37 + 0.41 &ndash; 0.78 = 0,</p>\n\n<p>then 0.37<sup>3</sup> + 0.41<sup>3</sup> &ndash; 0.78<sup>3</sup> = &ndash; 3 &times; 0.37 &times; 0.41 &times; 0.78</p>\n\n<p>So,</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3\\times0.74\\times1.23\\times0.13}{– 3 × 0.37 × 0.41 × 0.78}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3\\times2\\times0.37\\times3\\times0.41\\times0.13}{– 3 × 0.37 × 0.41 × 0.78}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3 × 0.37 × 0.41 × 0.78}{– 3 × 0.37 × 0.41 × 0.78}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; - 1</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The required answer is - 1.</strong></p>\n",
