      "id": "5f199f997089-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "If x = 6.29, y = 4.37, z = 1.92, then the value of (x 3 - y 3 - z 3 - 3xyz)/(x + y + z) is:",
      "questionHtml": "If x = 6.29, y = 4.37, z = 1.92, then the value of (x<sup>3</sup> - y<sup>3</sup> - z<sup>3 </sup>- 3xyz)/(x + y + z) is:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1.92",
          "html": "1.92"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4.37",
          "html": "4.37"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2.45",
          "html": "2.45"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">x = 6.29, y = 4.37, z = 1.92</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Formula used:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>(a + b)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ 3ab(a + b)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The relation between x , y and z is,</p>\n\n<p>x = y + z&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>6.29 = 4.37 + 1.92</p>\n\n<p>6.29 = 6.29</p>\n\n<p>LHS = RHS</p>\n\n<p>Taking Cube on both sides</p>\n\n<p>x<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= (y + z)<sup>3</sup></p>\n\n<p>x<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= y<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ z<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ 3yz(y + z)</p>\n\n<p>x<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= y<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ z<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ 3xyz [ x = y + z ]</p>\n\n<p>x<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- y<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- z<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- 3xyz = 0</p>\n\n<p>The value of&nbsp;<span style=\"\">(x</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- y</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;- z</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">- 3xyz)/(x + y + z),</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 0 / (x + y + z)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= 0</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Answer is 0.</span></strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
