      "solution": "<p><span style=\"\"> </span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left( {8{x^3} - \\frac{1}{{64{x^3}}}} \\right)\\)</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= (2x)</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> - (1/4x)</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p>= (2x - 1/4x)<sup>3</sup> + 3(2x)(1/4x)(2x - 1/4x)</p>\n\n<p>= 8<sup>3</sup> + (3/2)(8) = 512 + 12 = 524</p>\n",
