      "number": 10,
      "question": "What is the value of \\(\\frac{(2.247)^3+(1.730)^3+(1.023)^3−3 × 2.247 × 1.730 × 1.023}{(2.247)^2+(1.730)^2+(1.023)^2−2.247 × 1.730−1.730 × 1.023−2.247 × 1.023}\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">What</span> is the value of</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(2.247)^3+(1.730)^3+(1.023)^3−3 × 2.247 × 1.730 × 1.023}{(2.247)^2+(1.730)^2+(1.023)^2−2.247 × 1.730−1.730 × 1.023−2.247 × 1.023}\\)</span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
