        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5.247",
          "html": "5.247"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(2.247)^3+(1.730)^3+(1.023)^3−3 × 2.247 × 1.730 × 1.023}{(2.247)^2+(1.730)^2+(1.023)^2−2.247 × 1.730−1.730 × 1.023−2.247 × 1.023}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;+ c<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- 3abc = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ c<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- ab - bc - ca)</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Calculation:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(2.247)^3+(1.730)^3+(1.023)^3−3 × 2.247 × 1.730 × 1.023}{(2.247)^2+(1.730)^2+(1.023)^2−2.247 × 1.730−1.730 × 1.023−2.247 × 1.023}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>We know that,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">a<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;- 3abc = (a + b + c)(a<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;- ab - bc - ca)</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; (a + b + c) = (a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;- 3abc)/(a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ c<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;- ab - bc - ca) .</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Therefore, the required value&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; (2.247 + 1.730 + 1.023) = 5&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&there4; The required value is 5.</span></strong></p>\n",
